%% Container-level sequence: SD-04 Compare actual vs predicted (UC-04; FR-09, FR-10)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AN as Energy Analyst
  participant WEB as Web Dashboard<br/>(src/frontend)
  participant API as Backend API<br/>(api/compare.py)
  participant DB as Energy Database<br/>(SQLite)
  participant MS as Model Artifact Store<br/>(models/)

  AN->>WEB: open Comparison page, pick period
  WEB->>API: GET /api/compare?start=...&end=...
  API->>DB: SELECT measurements in period
  DB-->>API: rows (actual Appliances)
  API->>DB: SELECT stored predictions for those timestamps
  DB-->>API: predictions (may be partial)
  opt missing predictions
    API->>MS: use cached model
    API->>API: batch predict missing rows
    API->>DB: INSERT predictions (source=compare)
  end
  API->>API: compute MAE, RMSE, R2 for the period
  API-->>WEB: 200 {series[actual, predicted], metrics}
  WEB-->>AN: overlay chart + error summary table
